{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":502211,"name":"Noah","username":"Noah1","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/noah1/{size}/122247_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-27T18:54:30.031Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eBeen trying to connect Grokbot and 1Password for days now through the official connector, it creates the bot but won’t let me connect.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’ve tried service accounts, other methods. Keep getting this “credential delivery method is unknown”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf I go to 1password, it shows it tried to connect and created something but never works!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAny ideas?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/3/7/377b35046d361e4233a2a56483b4aacd6560fd19.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/7UOejrWdFZcDGnem38lSDvjE9Wp.png?dl=1\" title=\"Screenshot 2026-09-27 at 2.53.31 PM\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/3/7/377b35046d361e4233a2a56483b4aacd6560fd19_2_690x336.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-27 at 2.53.31 PM\" data-base62-sha1=\"7UOejrWdFZcDGnem38lSDvjE9Wp\" width=\"690\" height=\"336\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/3/7/377b35046d361e4233a2a56483b4aacd6560fd19_2_690x336.png, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/3/7/377b35046d361e4233a2a56483b4aacd6560fd19_2_1035x504.png 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/3/7/377b35046d361e4233a2a56483b4aacd6560fd19_2_1380x672.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F1F1F1\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eScreenshot 2026-09-27 at 2.53.31 PM\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1628×794 42.4 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-ico