ox fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"11:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Models, pricing \u0026amp; API keys (availability, Auto/Max, BYOK/Bedrock)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"12:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e MCP \u0026amp; tools\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"13:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Cloud Agents \u0026amp; Automations (\u003ca href=\"http://cursor.com/agents\"\u003ecursor.com/agents\u003c/a\u003e, scheduled/event)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"14:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e BugBot \u0026amp; Code Review\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"15:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Cursor CLI\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"16:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Cursor Mobile\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"17:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Remote (SSH / Dev Containers / WSL)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"18:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Account, billing \u0026amp; login\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"19:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Something else…\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nA clear and concise description of what the bug is.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nHow can you reproduce this bug? We have a much better chance at fixing issues if we can reproduce them!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e…\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e…\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e…\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nWhat is meant to happen here that isn’t working correctly?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nIf applicable, attach images or videos (.jpg, .png, .gif, .mp4, .mov)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOperating System\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"48:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Windows 10/11\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"49:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e MacOS\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"50:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Linux\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVersion Information\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFor Cursor IDE: Menu → About Cursor → Copy\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFor Cursor CLI: Run \u003ccode\u003eagent about\u003c/code\u003e in your terminal\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cpre\u003e\u003ccode class=\"lang-auto\"\u003eIDE:\nVersion: 2.xx.x\nVSCode Version: 1.105.1\nCommit: ......\n\nCLI:\nCLI Version 2026.01.17-d239e66\n\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFor AI issues: which model did you use?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nModel name (e.g., Sonnet 4, Tab…)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFor AI issues: add Request ID with privacy disabled\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nRequest ID: f9a7046a-279b-47e5-ab48-6e8dc12daba1\u003cbr\u003e\nFor Background Agent issues, also post the ID: bc-…\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nAdd any other context about the problem here.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"87:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Yes - Cursor is unusable\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"88:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Sometimes - I can sometimes use Cursor\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"89:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e No - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/details\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe more details you provide, the easier it is for us to reproduce and fix the issue. Thanks!\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":2,"post_type":1,"posts_count":5,"updated_at":"2026-09-27T18:54:37.486Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":1.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":173142,"topic_slug":"grokbot-1password","display_username":"system","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"http://cursor.com/agents","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":-1,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grokbot-1password/173142/2","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":true},{"id":502215,"name":"Discourse AI Spam Scanner","username":"discourse_ai_spam","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/d/c68b51/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-27T18:54:38.121Z","cooked":"","post_number":5,"post_type":3,"posts_count":5,"updated_at":"2026-09-27T18:54:38.121Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":1.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":173142,"topic_slug":"grokbot-1password","display_username":"Discourse AI Spam Scanner","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":-3,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"action_code":"visible.disabled","post_url":"/t/grokbot-1password/173142/5","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":true},{"id":502233,"name":"system","username":"system","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/system/{size}/99069_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-27T19:38:24.217Z","cooked":"","post_number":7,"post_type":3,"posts_count":5,"updated_at":"2026-09-27T19:38:24.217Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":0.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":173142,"topic_slug":"grokbot-1password","display_username":"system","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":-1,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"action_code":"visible.enabled","post_url":"/t/grokbot-1password/173142/7","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":true},{"id":502242,"name":"Colin","username":"Colin","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/colin/{size}/90452_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-27T19:55:49.659Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/noah1\"\u003e@Noah1\u003c/a\u003e, thanks for the report and the screenshots!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe looked into it. The connection is failing because one of the logins in the vault you’re sharing with Grok Bot has an extremely long website address saved on it (over 2,000 characters, usually a sign-in link with a long redirect or tracking string copied from the address bar). Right now that one item stops the whole connection, and the app only shows the generic “delivery outcome is unknown” message. I’ve flagged this to the team.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn the meantime, this should get you connected:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIn 1Password, open the “Shared with Grok Bot” vault (or whichever vault you picked when connecting).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGo through the Login items and look at each item’s website field. Find any with a very long address.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEdit that website down to just the site’s normal address (for example \u003ccode\u003ehttps://example.com\u003c/code\u003e) and save.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFully quit Grok Bot with Cmd+Q. Closing the window isn’t enough, since the connect dialog stays blocked until the app restarts.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReopen Grok Bot and click Connect 1Password again.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you can’t spot the item, move everything out of that vault temporarily, connect with the empty vault, then move the items back in.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlso, each failed attempt created a leftover service account named “Grok Bot agents” plus a date in your 1Password account. You can safely delete the extra ones in \u003ca href=\"http://1Password.com\"\u003e1Password.com\u003c/a\u003e under Developer, then Service Accounts.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLet me know if it still fails after that!\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":8,"post_type":1,"posts_count":5,"updated_at":"2026-09-27T19:55:49.659Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":5.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":173142,"topic_slug":"grokbot-1password","display_username":"Colin","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"http://1Password.com","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Password Manager, Secrets, and Access Management | 1Password","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":"Community Support Engineer","title_is_group":false,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":87436,"hidden":false,"trust_level":3,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grokbot-1password/173142/8","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":true},{"id":502255,"name":"Noah","username":"Noah1","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/noah1/{size}/122247_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-27T20:13:16.762Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eInteresting! I don’t see anything weird like that, but removing everything \u003cstrong\u003eworked\u003c/strong\u003e and allowed me to connect, now I’ll slowly move things back in.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThanks so much for that!\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":14,"post_type":1,"posts_count":5,"updated_at":"2026-09-27T20:13:16.762Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":2,"readers_count":1,"score":0.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":173142,"topic_slug":"grokbot-1password","display_username":"Noah","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":140033,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grokbot-1password/173142/14","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":true,"topic_accepted_answer":true},{"id":502257,"name":"Noah","username":"Noah1","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/noah1/{size}/122247_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-27T20:22:09.288Z","cooked":"\u003caside class=\"quote group-CursorStaff\" data-username=\"Colin\" data-post=\"8\" data-topic=\"173142\" data-full=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"quote-controls\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cimg alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://sea3.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/colin/48/90452_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"\u003e Colin:\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHey \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/noah1\"\u003e@Noah1\u003c/a\u003e, thanks for the report and the screenshots!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe looked into it. The connection is failing because one of the logins in the vault you’re sharing with Grok Bot has an extremely long website address saved on it (over 2,000 characters, usually a sign-in link with a long redirect or tracking string copied from the address bar). Right now that one item stops the whole connection, and the app only shows the generic “delivery outcome is unknown” message. I’ve flagged this to the team.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn the meantime, this should get you connected:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIn 1Password, open the “Shared with Grok Bot” vault (or whichever vault you picked when connecting).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGo through the Login items and look at each item’s website field. Find any with a very long address.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEdit that website down to just the site’s normal address (for example \u003ccode\u003ehttps://example.com\u003c/code\u003e) and save.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFully quit Grok Bot with Cmd+Q. Closing the window isn’t enough, since the connect dialog stays blocked until the app restarts.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReopen Grok Bot and click Connect 1Password again.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you can’t spot the item, move everything out of that vault temporarily, connect with the empty vault, then move the items back in.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlso, each failed attempt created a leftover service account named “Grok Bot agents” plus a date in your 1Password account. You can safely delete the extra ones in \u003ca href=\"http://1Password.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e1Password.com\u003c/a\u003e under Developer, then Service Accounts.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLet me know if it still fails after that!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGreat support! All fixed!\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":15,"post_type":1,"posts_count":5,"updated_at":"2026-09-27T20:22:09.288Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":1,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":2,"readers_count":1,"score":45.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":173142,"topic_slug":"grokbot-1password","display_username":"Noah","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":140033,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grokbot-1password/173142/15","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":true}],"stream":[502211,502212,502215,502233,502242,502255,502257]},"timeline_lookup":[[1,0]],"suggested_topics":[],"tags":[{"id":416,"name":"grok-bot","slug":"grok-bot"}],"tags_descriptions":{},"fancy_title":"Grokbot \u0026amp; 1Password","id":173142,"title":"Grokbot \u0026 1Password","posts_count":5,"created_at":"2026-09-27T18:54:29.976Z","views":18,"reply_count":0,"like_count":1,"last_posted_at":"2026-09-27T20:22:09.288Z","visible":true,"closed":false,"archived":false,"has_summary":false,"archetype":"regular","slug":"grokbot-1password","category_id":6,"word_count":949,"deleted_at":null,"user_id":140033,"featured_link":null,"pinned_g